# Build output
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Turbo
.turbo/

# Test output
coverage/

# `export` bundles are a build artifact of an already-committed render: reproducible from the
# spec at any time, and named for a channel rather than for the repo. Rendered PNGs under
# marketing/ are committed on purpose (see below); an upload bundle is not.
export/

# Rendered assets are committed on purpose: byte-identical PNGs across runs are
# what makes an approved screenshot diffable and reviewable (CLAUDE.md invariant 7).
# Golden files under packages/*/test are the determinism guarantee itself.
# Neither may be added here.

# Local design reference, deliberately never pushed. See reference/hvac-lead-loss/README.md.
# Read roadmap.md:119 before trusting it: the spacing in these renders is known wrong.
/reference/

